      "tag": "deprecation",
      "why_it_matters_for_FDEs": "Customer workflows pinned to these models break now; Copilot Enterprise admins may need to enable the replacement models in their model policies.",
      "verified": "2026-10-20"
    },
    {
      "title": "IBM's ALTK-Evolve tops τ²-bench customer service with GPT-4.1 and learned memory",
      "summary": "IBM Research shows a stock ReAct agent on GPT-4.1, given guidelines learned from past runs, reaching 67.5% Pass^4 on τ²-bench retail, above every retail entry in its Oct 12 leaderboard snapshot, without changing model weights.",
